{"ancestors": "0,9010270,9010335", "bizKey": "9015739", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-07-05 17:20:43", "detail": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>题材基本面介绍：</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p>据ICSG统计，铜全球总资源量丰富，达56亿吨，查明的资源量21亿吨，全球储量8.8亿吨，全球铜矿产能2600万吨，铜矿产量2120万吨。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/05/fea4bb1e-b152-4fb8-b1fd-d87da9905dcd-1688544328721.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 390.97px;height: 300.09px;\"/></p><p>铜价主要受到经济表现及其金融属性影响，历史铜价总体可分为三个阶段：</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/05/af55af64-e446-4b82-bc81-71debc72a229-1688544374611.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 390.99px;height: 249.01px;\"/></p><p>铜矿开发时间周期长：</p><p>根据S&P Global Market Intelligence数据，铜矿项目发现、勘探与研究平均需要约13.4年时间，而可研结束至矿山建设平均需要约1.9年，从建设至最终投产又需要约3.2年，累积需要约18.5年时间。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/05/960012e6-d1fb-41ee-af00-52fc3c7ed5b2-1688544470377.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 392.99px;height: 217.34px;\"/></p><p>前五大产铜国合计占比逾60%。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/05/c4a16fa8-05ef-4d2a-8a7a-d04e0c8d6130-1688544516590.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><br></p><p>中国占全球铜消费量超过一半，达到51%。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/07/05/ef92f3e2-8468-4ef5-92e7-b820a6800a84-1688544608237.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "TK", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "铜矿", "parentId": 9010335, "pctChg": -2.97, "reason": "重要有色金属之一，铜", "remark": "", "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9015739, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-07-05 17:20:43"}
